WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.405
Ricky: Oh no! Rachel! Where are you?

2
00:00:12.406 --> 00:00:17.217
She has to be here somewhere.

3
00:00:17.218 --> 00:00:21.633
Mom is going to be so upset! Mom:

4
00:00:21.634 --> 00:00:26.672
Upset about what? Ricky:

5
00:00:26.673 --> 00:00:31.281
Uh, mom, did you find your wallet? Mom:

6
00:00:31.282 --> 00:00:34.417
Yes. Where is your sister? Ricky:

7
00:00:34.418 --> 00:00:39.163
I . . . I . . . I don’t know.

8
00:00:39.164 --> 00:00:46.143
Mom: What? You mean she’s missing?

9
00:00:46.144 --> 00:00:49.979
Excuse me. Have you seen a little girl? Guard:

10
00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:56.078
No, I haven’t.

11
00:00:56.079 --> 00:01:00.082
Ricky: Oh, this is all my fault.

12
00:01:00.083 --> 00:01:04.880
Mom: We can’t give up!

13
00:01:04.881 --> 00:01:09.212
Woman: We are looking for Rachel.

14
00:01:09.213 --> 00:01:22.090
She is wearing a pink dress.

15
00:01:22.091 --> 00:01:25.429
Mom: I’m sure someone has seen Rachel.

16
00:01:25.430 --> 00:01:31.525
Ricky: I hope she’s all right.

